19934860,2026-03-03,Debt collection,Telecommunications debt,Attempts to collect debt not owed,Debt is not yours,"I am filing this complaint against Jefferson Capital Systems , LLC for reporting and attempting to collect an alleged XXXX XXXX debt that I formally disputed. 

On XX/XX/XXXX, I sent a certified debt validation request and notice of dispute to the company. The certified mail receipt confirms delivery and signature. In my letter, I requested the original signed contract, full itemized accounting, proof of assignment/chain of title from XXXX, and proof that the company is licensed to collect debt in the State of Florida. 

