20512037,2026-03-23,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Problem with a purchase shown on your statement,Credit card company isn't resolving a dispute about a purchase on your statement,"I purchased a trip THROUGH AMEX TRAVEL SPECIFICALLY NO OTHER THIRD PARTY for a hotel in XXXX from XXXX worth {$2200.00} In the beginning of XXXX we ran into a personal/family emergency and called the hotel ( XXXX Centric Times Square XXXX XXXX We were considering our options on if we could make the trip or postpone it. We asked the hotel if we could receive a credit for a future stay since we did want to take the trip and didn't know the cancellation policy for emergencies. 

